3. ⚠️ LIMITS
==============================================================================================================
  · TEACHER-FORCED cube. This is the emission's dispersion given the trunk's mu/theta,
    not a statement about the delivered autoregressive regime (C-399).
  · The spread-error relation is a DIAGNOSTIC, not a FAO-02 column. Driving a selection
    decision with it needs Simon's amendment to FAO-02 first.
  · G-5's closed form is over DRAWS only and ignores threshold_gate's mask, so it bounds
    the any-fire rate from above wherever the gate closes a cell.
  · n=1 checkpoint, sb only, no sigma-hat on any number here.

